# RESETIUS | 
# RESETIUS |     angle 6
# RESETIUS |     axiom C21Y-Y-Y-Y-Y-Y-
# RESETIUS | 
# RESETIUS |     F=F[@I2[--F][-F][+F][++F]]<2F[--F][-F][+F][++F]F>2[@I2[--F][-F][+F][++F]]F
